      "id": "claim_7d6636c450d6425c9008bd9ce30f0e3f",
      "statement": "The repository supports two mutually exclusive local development modes: host-run backend/frontend using the production-shaped Compose backing services, or a shared development Compose stack that containerizes both application ends; the modes reuse data volumes but collide on default ports.",
